<title>USA: Pasadena Commission, Calif., ylds 6.25 pct in 2014.</title>
<headline>Pasadena Commission, Calif., ylds 6.25 pct in 2014.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EJ De La Rosa &amp; Co Inc said Thursday it tentatively priced $3.5 million Pasadena Community Development Commission, Calif., bonds at a top yield of 6.25 percent in 2014.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>PASADENA COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT COMMISSION</p>
<p>CAIFORNIA</p>
<p>1996 TAX ALLOCATION BONDS</p>
<p>TOWNHOUSE PROJECT</p>
<p>DATED: 9/1/96</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 2/1/1997</p>
<p>RATINGS: MOODY'S NR, S&amp;P A-MINUS</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 08/01/2006 @ 102.00, DTP 08/01/2008.</p>
<p>    8/1	     Amount*	 Coupon	Price</p>
<p>    Maturity	(million)	   (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    1997	    $0.125	  4.125	 4.25</p>
<p>    1998	    $0.130	  4.25	  4.45</p>
<p>    1999	    $0.135	  4.50	  4.60</p>
<p>    2000	    $0.140	  4.625	 4.75</p>
<p>    2001	    $0.150	  4.80	  4.90</p>
<p>    2002	    $0.155	  4.90	  5.05</p>
<p>    2003	    $0.165	  5.00	  5.20</p>
<p>    2004	    $0.170	  5.10	  5.30</p>
<p>    2005	    $0.180	  5.20	  5.40</p>
<p>    2006	    $0.190	  5.30	  5.50</p>
<p>    2014	    $1.965	  6.00	  6.25</p>
<p>* - Approximate subject to change.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
